@startuml ASignX_System_Architecture_Detailed
title ASignX - Detailed current system architecture
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam ArrowColor #526581
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #F7FAFF
skinparam componentBorderColor #AFC5ED
skinparam nodeBorderColor #AFC5ED
skinparam ranksep 45

actor "People\nGuest, learner, administrator" as Users
node "User device / web browser" {
 component "React workspace\nPublic catalog and sample lessons\nEnrollment, lessons, results and progress\nAdmin course/sign authoring and text import\nSign Strike simulated/keyboard demo" as Workspace
 component "Camera and frame stream\nMediaDevices -> resized JPEG frames\nOne active request + newest pending frame" as Camera
 component "Supabase JS client\nAccount/session operations\nStorage upload and signed media URL" as SupabaseClient
 component "Live text composition\nStabilized letters -> provisional words\nWord/sentence assistance and final formatting\nTransient session state" as Composer
}
node "Application server / Express + TypeScript" {
 component "Request boundary\nInput limits and validation\nSupabase identity checks on protected routes\nCurrent database roles and ownership checks" as Boundary
 component "Learner routes\nEnrollments, material, profile and progress\nRuns, automatic grading, hearts and XP\nHeart-practice restoration" as Learning
 component "Admin authoring\nCourses, graphics, signs and video attachment\nLesson/question validation and batched writes\nText import preview/save and course lifecycle" as Authoring
 component "Recognition gateway\nPublic ASignLive sessions and NLP routes\nLearner/run-bound camera grading sessions\nPrivate service token and bounded requests" as Gateway
 component "Data access\nPostgres.js connection pool\nDrizzle schema and migration definitions\nSQL transactions, locks and integrity rules" as DataAccess
}
node "Private Python process / FastAPI" {
 component "Session registry\nOpaque session IDs and expiry\nPer-session inference state and CPU work" as Registry
 component "MediaPipe HandLandmarker\nImage decoding and hand landmarks\nFeature preparation and temporal buffers" as Landmarks
 component "ONNX Runtime CPU\nStatic and sequence classifiers\nConfidence and stabilization" as Inference
 component "SymSpell\nWord matching and sentence segmentation" as NLP
}
artifact "Local private assets\nserver/private/models/asignx/*.onnx\nClassifier metadata JSON\nmediapipe/hand_landmarker.task" as Assets
cloud "Supabase" {
 component "Supabase Auth\nEmail confirmation, login, recovery\nAccess tokens and session refresh" as Auth
 database "PostgreSQL\n23 public application tables\nauth.users and storage object metadata\nRLS, constraints, grading/validation triggers" as DB
 component "Supabase Storage\nPrivate learning-media bucket\nAdmin MP4 writes and policy-checked reads\nTime-limited signed demonstration URLs" as Storage
}
Users --> Workspace
Workspace --> SupabaseClient : Account and media actions
Workspace --> Camera : Start Live or lesson camera
Camera --> Boundary : JPEG + session ID + timestamp
Workspace --> Boundary : Public/protected JSON requests
Boundary --> Learning
Boundary --> Authoring
Boundary --> Gateway
Learning --> DataAccess
Authoring --> DataAccess : Persist content and verify\nstored media metadata
Gateway --> DataAccess : Verify learner/run and save\ntrusted exercise outcomes
Learning --> Gateway : Recognition question flow
Gateway <--> Registry : Private session/frame HTTP\nX-Recognition-Key
Registry --> Landmarks
Landmarks --> Inference
Landmarks --> Assets : Read hand landmarker
Inference --> Assets : Read classifiers and metadata
Gateway <--> NLP : Private word/sentence HTTP
Composer --> Boundary : Raw letter groups / provisional text
Gateway --> Composer : Recognition and NLP responses\nvia browser request responses
SupabaseClient --> Auth : Account/session operations
Boundary --> Auth : Verify access token for protected routes
SupabaseClient --> Storage : Upload/read permitted sign media
DataAccess --> DB : Transactional SQL
Auth ..> DB : Auth identity and confirmed-profile trigger
Storage ..> DB : Managed object metadata / policy checks
note bottom of Workspace
  Camera recognition serves Live and learner sign questions.
  Sign Strike currently accepts simulated/keyboard input.
end note
note bottom of DataAccess
  XP comes from the award ledger.
  Heart balances, deductions and rewards share transaction locks.
  Text imports create drafts and save atomically.
end note
note bottom of Registry
  Camera frames and recognition session state are in memory.
  Python listens on 127.0.0.1:8001 in the local launcher.
end note
legend bottom
 Current code: 5 November 2026. This is a logical component/process view.
 Vite 5173 proxies /api and /health to Express 3000 during development.
 Protected API requests verify Supabase identity and server-side permissions.
 Curated sign videos persist in Storage; lesson outcomes persist in PostgreSQL.
endlegend
@enduml
